      "content": "ASHLEY GREEN           GROVE LANE SP 90 SE 2/7                                                      Barn to South-East of                                                      Grove Farmhouse                                                      II Early C18 timber-framed and weatherboarded barn of 5 bays with additional bay to west.  Hipped old tile roof with gablets.  Brick plinth.  Centre cart entry.  Raking queen post trusses.  Braced tie beams, wall plates and purlins.  Flint and brick lean-to at south-west. Listing NGR: SP9861804190"
    }
